@startuml C4-Dynamic-Globe-Bootstrap
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false

title Dynamic — Globe bootstrap (GlobeService.mount → dispose)

actor "Browser User" as user
participant "Theme Page\n(Angular)" as page <<ui>>
participant "GlobeHostComponent" as host
participant "GlobeService" as globe
participant "GlobeGroup" as root
participant "WebGL Canvas" as canvas

user -> page: 1. Open /globe-light or /globe-dark
page -> host: 2. render app-globe-host
host -> globe: 3. mount(container, canvas, options)
globe -> root: 4. new GlobeGroup(...)
root --> globe: 5. scene graph
globe -> canvas: 6. requestAnimationFrame
globe --> host: 7. GlobeSession
page --> user: 8. Interactive globe

note right of host
  On destroy: session.dispose()
  stops rAF and removes listeners
end note

user -> page: 9. Leave route / unmount
page -> host: 10. ngOnDestroy
host -> globe: 11. dispose()

@enduml
